 2. **Neighborhood Selection**: Identify the 4 indices along each dimension: $idx_d - 1, idx_d, idx_d + 1, idx_d + 2$. This defines a $4 \times 4 \times 4$ grid of 64 voxel coordinates [S1, unofficial].
