+3. **Weight Calculation**: For each dimension, compute the 1D kernel weights for the 4 offsets relative to the query point. The distances to the samples at $idx-1, idx, idx+1, idx+2$ are $1+\delta_d, \delta_d, 1-\delta_d, 2-\delta_d$ respectively [S1, unofficial].
